{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The King is Calling!\u00a0</strong><br> <br>Play as <strong>Vincent Pogo</strong>, a world-famous performer who embarks on a journey back to the Royal Kingdom using his trusty pogo stick as his main form of traversal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>My Name Is Vincent Pogo</i>, you\u2019ll bounce, balance, and flip your way through a magical land filled with danger. Traverse towering cliffs, leap across vast chasms, and uncover ancient technologies that propel you to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Jump Counts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vincent is fully physics-driven. Tilt, lean, and bounce your pogo stick off of any surface - time your jumps to increase your bounce height or keep a low bounce to make more controlled jumps. Every angle and every landing is in your hands, demanding precision and rewarding  creativity in how you traverse the landscape.\u00a0One slip, and you\u2019ll come crashing down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/6ce66e3e80cb24116ae0111f6765b615.poster.avif?t=1769638184\" aria-label=\"Gameplay\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/6ce66e3e80cb24116ae0111f6765b615.webm?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/6ce66e3e80cb24116ae0111f6765b615.mp4?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path Carefully</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path you choose can make or break your run in each area. Explore and use your creativity to trudge on through the world of Vincent Pogo. The world opens up as you unlock valuable checkpoints, save your journey and revisit locations. Choose your path carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/0690e600f8d21bfb2726bf6ac22580dd.poster.avif?t=1769638184\" aria-label=\"Reaching a checkpoint\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/0690e600f8d21bfb2726bf6ac22580dd.webm?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/0690e600f8d21bfb2726bf6ac22580dd.mp4?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Handcrafted World to Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vibrant, hand-drawn world full of secrets, hazards, and machines. From rolling meadows, to towering cliffs, each region offers new challenges and new ways to master your pogo stick. Search for portals that open the path to new locations as you make your way towards the Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/b4486f0fd659f5dfe1e73d937c3ef65d.poster.avif?t=1769638184\" aria-label=\"A hand crafted world\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/b4486f0fd659f5dfe1e73d937c3ef65d.webm?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/b4486f0fd659f5dfe1e73d937c3ef65d.mp4?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge and Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall teaches you something new. Success comes not from luck, but from learning the rhythm of the pogo stick. Practice your skills and push yourself a little bit further each time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/d2ac3a2fc2b89d363b1501e66be36d5b.poster.avif?t=1769638184\" aria-label=\"Death sequence\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/d2ac3a2fc2b89d363b1501e66be36d5b.webm?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/d2ac3a2fc2b89d363b1501e66be36d5b.mp4?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827520?t=1769638184","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/178a4d0b83c1e13f856a41650cad227896d5d107/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769638184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/6d92d770f50fe25301b25889332282c444b9dfa6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769638184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/6d92d770f50fe25301b25889332282c444b9dfa6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769638184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The King is Calling!\u00a0</stron