 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/0690e600f8d21bfb2726bf6ac22580dd.poster.avif?t=1769638184\" aria-label=\"Reaching a checkpoint\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/0690e600f8d21bfb2726bf6ac22580dd.webm?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/0690e600f8d21bfb2726bf6ac22580dd.mp4?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Handcrafted World to Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vibrant, hand-drawn world full of secrets, hazards, and machines. From rolling meadows, to towering cliffs, each region offers new challenges and new ways to master your pogo stick. Search for portals that open the path to new locations as you make your way towards the Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/b4486f0fd659f5dfe1e73d937c3ef65d.poster.avif?t=1769638184\" aria-label=\"A hand crafted world\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/b4486f0fd659f5dfe1e73d937c3ef65d.webm?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/b4486f0fd659f5dfe1e73d937c3ef65d.mp4?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge and Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall teaches you something new. Success comes not from luck, but from learning the rhythm of the pogo stick. Practice your skills and push yourself a little bit further each time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/d2ac3a2fc2b89d363b1501e66be36d5b.poster.avif?t=1769638184\" aria-label=\"Death sequence\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/d2ac3a2fc2b89d363b1501e66be36d5b.webm?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/extras/d2ac3a2fc2b89d363b1501e66be36d5b.mp4?t=1769638184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Not So Hard Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827520/81ef31e12f44654ca837aa1b8dedc7578a78dac9/header.jpg?t=1769638184","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"My Name Is Vincent Pogo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 980, AMD RX 470, Intel UHD graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Not So Hard Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date"